# Production parameters for the official launch on Arc mainnet (chain 5042).
# Decided 2026-09-16: P=5000 / G=10000 -> graduation at ~45k USDC market cap,
# x9 from the opening price, ~10.3k USDC of net buys to graduate.
# Usage (PRIVATE_KEY comes from .env's MAINNET_PRIVATE_KEY, never from here):
#   set -a; source .env; source deploy/ash-mainnet.env; set +a   # production values last
#   PRIVATE_KEY=$MAINNET_PRIVATE_KEY forge script script/DeployArc.s.sol \
#     --rpc-url https://rpc.mainnet.arc.io --broadcast --slow --legacy --with-gas-price 30gwei
#   (check `cast gas-price` first: Arc's fee left its 20 gwei plateau on 2026-09-16; anything below it is dropped silently)
